" Tokyo Night Moon, sourced by vimrc
" Colors from third_party/tokyonight.nvim/extras/vim/colors/tokyonight-moon.vim
" (folke/tokyonight.nvim), linked as vim/pack/plugin/start/tokyonight
" Put the package on runtimepath now: its tokyonight.vim uses :runtime, which
" only sees pack/*/start after vimrc is done
packadd! tokyonight
set background=dark
colorscheme tokyonight-moon
